00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.310
Managing your billing
inside of the Cloud

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.230
can be a difficult task.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.540
Most Cloud providers
employ a pay

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.080
for what you use model, which
means that if you're closely

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.600
