centralized billing reporting

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:49.500
and have low visibility
into your Cloud spend,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.460
unwanted or unknown spending
can really start to add up.

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.520
Additionally, each
Cloud provider

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.340
has their own billing
methodology, their own suite

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:02.640
of SKUs and services, and
their own way of reporting

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.160
that information back to you.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.130
This means that as a
member of the FinOps team,

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:12.090
you might spend hours manually
centralizing, reconciling,

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:15.510
and harmonizing billing
across services and providers

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:19.200
each month, all to ask
a simple question like,

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.380
what did our marketing teams
cost us in Cloud Infrastructure

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.400
last quarter?

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.920
Well, don't worry.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.560
Because, today, we're
going to walk through how

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:32.820
you can leverage Looker's Cloud
cost management solution to not

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.890
only control costs
for your organization,

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:39.390
but also reduced waste
and predictably forecast

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:42.280
both cost and resource needs.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:46.780
So what makes Looker so
great to solve this problem?

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:49.620
Well, Looker is a business
intelligence platform

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:52.770
