00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:02.970
This is all powered by Looker's
modeling layer, LookML.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.510
With LookML, analysts can
define a single source of truth

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:09.960
for metrics used across
your organization.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.480
And Looker goes
beyond traditional BI,

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.910
offering integrations
to deliver data

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.910
when and where you need it.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.860
When it comes to
Cost Management,

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:24.850
Looker offers real-time insights
into Cloud spend and usage

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:28.710
so that Cloud users across
teams or cost centers

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.470
